# Atlas Core Lean Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Torq Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D11 21:35  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Cost-optimized component token dictionary for Atlas Core, consolidating SaaS platform UI and Face to Face kiosk styles into a minimal-footprint token schema adhering to the Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "meta": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Torq Marlow",
    "strategy": "Cost-Cutter Lean System (Zero-Bloat Token Hierarchy)",
    "governance": "Derived directly from 'Company Document' to align multi-tier SaaS and F2F service styling without redundant asset generation."
  },
  "color": {
    "brand": {
      "primary": { "value": "#0F4C81", "type": "color", "description": "Sourced from Company Document brand specs." },
      "accent": { "value": "#28A745", "type": "color" }
    },
    "surface": {
      "base": { "value": "#FFFFFF", "type": "color" },
      "subtle": { "value": "#F4F6F8", "type": "color" },
      "interactive": { "value": "{color.brand.primary}", "type": "color" }
    },
    "text": {
      "primary": { "value": "#1A1D20", "type": "color" },
      "muted": { "value": "#5F6B7A", "type": "color" },
      "inverse": { "value": "#FFFFFF", "type": "color" }
    }
  },
  "space": {
    "xs": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" },
    "sm": { "value": "8px", "type": "dimension" },
    "md": { "value": "16px", "type": "dimension" },
    "lg": { "value": "24px", "type": "dimension" }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": { "value": "{color.brand.primary}" },
        "color": { "value": "{color.text.inverse}" },
        "padding-y": { "value": "{space.sm}" },
        "padding-x": { "value": "{space.md}" },
        "radius": { "value": "4px" }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "background": { "value": "{color.surface.base}" },
      "padding": { "value": "{space.md}" },
      "border": { "value": "1px solid {color.surface.subtle}" }
    }
  }
}
```